    "This matrix is blocked and is not T30 release signoff. The deterministic visualization.trend hydration mismatch requires a product-source fix and a fresh complete exact-source rerun.",
    "Measurements describe one isolated Apple M4 Pro/macOS runner and one headless Chromium build; they do not establish lower-powered-device, cross-browser or field behavior.",
    "The Node and loaded-page first/subsequent observations are not equivalent to process, HTTP-cache or device cold starts. Node timing showed material same-source p95 variability across three retained attempts.",
    "Visible-input timing ends at an observed DOM mutation, not paint. Missing or threshold-censored Event Timing entries do not prove a fast interaction; the deliberate calibration only verifies that the observation path can report a long event.",
